#  Media widget for the QNX Photon shelf's dock.
#
#  Swallowed by FvwmButtons from the Media group in shelfdock.items.  It is an
#  FvwmScript rather than a row of FvwmButtons cells because PeriodicTasks can
#  poll the track title on a timer without the caller having to know a button's
#  index in the generated config.
#
#  Two things this build of FvwmScript cannot do, both established by testing
#  rather than assumed:
#
#    - Icon is broken.  A widget carrying one fails to draw and takes every
#      later widget with it, for PNG and XPM alike, on the VM and the host.
#      So the transport glyphs are text.  bin/fvwmscript-icontest reproduces it.
#    - HScrollBar cannot drive anything.  It does not emit SingleClic when
#      moved, and numeric case labels ("1 :") do not parse, so no message is
#      left to catch.  The screenshot's volume slider is therefore a -/+ pair
#      around a readout: a slider that moved but did nothing would be a worse
#      affordance than no slider at all.
#
#  All shell work is in bin/shelf-media, which talks MPRIS over gdbus and reads
#  the sink volume from wpctl.  It answers in about 4ms and prints a placeholder
#  rather than failing when no player is running, which matters because
#  PeriodicTasks calls it on a timer.

WindowTitle {ShelfMedia}
WindowSize  152 70
Font "xft:Sans:size=8:antialias=True"
ForeColor {black}
BackColor {#d9d9d9}
HilightColor {#ffffff}
ShadowColor {#a7a7a7}

Init
 Begin
  Set $Track = (GetOutput {/home/deer/.fvwm/bin/shelf-media title} 1 -1)
  ChangeTitle 1 $Track
  Set $Vol = (GetOutput {/home/deer/.fvwm/bin/shelf-media vol} 1 -1)
  ChangeTitle 7 $Vol
 End

PeriodicTasks
 Begin
  #  Every other second.  Volume is re-read here as well as on our own -/+
  #  clicks, so the readout still follows the sink when something else moves it.
  If (RemainderOfDiv (GetTime) 2)==0 Then
  Begin
   Set $Track = (GetOutput {/home/deer/.fvwm/bin/shelf-media title} 1 -1)
   ChangeTitle 1 $Track
   Set $Vol = (GetOutput {/home/deer/.fvwm/bin/shelf-media vol} 1 -1)
   ChangeTitle 7 $Vol
  End
 End

#  ---- Widget 1: track title ----------------------------------------------
#  bin/shelf-media truncates to 24 characters, because FvwmScript does not clip
#  a title: an over-long one widens the widget and pushes the shelf out of shape.
Widget 1
Property
 Position 0 0
 Size 152 18
 Type ItemDraw
 Flags Left
 Title {}
Main
 Case message of
  SingleClic :
  Begin
  End
 End

#  ---- Widgets 2-5: transport ----------------------------------------------
#  Four 38px buttons across the 152px width, in the screenshot's order:
#  previous, stop, play/pause, next.
Widget 2
Property
 Position 0 20
 Size 38 22
 Type PushButton
 Title {<<}
Main
 Case message of
  SingleClic :
  Begin
   Do {Exec exec /home/deer/.fvwm/bin/shelf-media prev}
  End
 End

